WEBVTT

00:00:56.328 --> 00:01:02.559
(The Shadow Sovereign)

00:01:02.843 --> 00:01:05.520
(Episode 13)

00:01:08.644 --> 00:01:11.360
(Princess Zhao Yang's Residence)

00:01:16.333 --> 00:01:17.535
Climb up.

00:01:18.147 --> 00:01:19.989
How did you know there was a rope here?

00:01:22.346 --> 00:01:23.548
Go up first.

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.452
Come up.

00:01:42.747 --> 00:01:43.949
Le Sheng.

00:01:46.083 --> 00:01:48.226
There must be guards at the entrance. We'll sneak in through the window.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:49.452
Come on.

00:02:07.083 --> 00:02:08.285
Wait.

00:02:09.873 --> 00:02:12.029
How do you know this place so well?

00:02:12.201 --> 00:02:14.041
You'd better have a good explanation for this.

00:02:15.285 --> 00:02:17.730
Well, I come here a lot.

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:19.160
You come here a lot?

00:02:20.656 --> 00:02:22.818
Saving your sister is what matters most right now.

00:02:23.797 --> 00:02:24.999
Keep up.

00:02:36.627 --> 00:02:37.829
Shen Xiao.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:39.422
Shen Xiao.

00:02:50.089 --> 00:02:51.291
Shen Xiao.

00:02:54.813 --> 00:02:56.015
Who is it?

00:03:03.025 --> 00:03:04.308
What are you doing here?

00:03:04.435 --> 00:03:05.637
I'm here to get you out.

00:03:08.242 --> 00:03:09.484
Are you feeling better?

00:03:12.611 --> 00:03:13.892
You came too?

00:03:17.626 --> 00:03:19.600
I came to rescue you.

00:03:19.853 --> 00:03:21.414
But now it looks like,

00:03:21.591 --> 00:03:23.408
I'm not really needed here after all.

00:03:26.958 --> 00:03:28.475
Neither of you should've come.

00:03:28.595 --> 00:03:30.278
What if someone catches you?

00:03:30.523 --> 00:03:32.443
Let's get you out of here first. I'll carry you.

00:03:33.167 --> 00:03:34.970
Censor Shen is still hurt.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.892
Let me carry you instead, Sister.

00:03:39.375 --> 00:03:41.619
Move aside. I can walk on my own.

00:03:46.659 --> 00:03:47.900
Go on, drink.

00:03:49.305 --> 00:03:50.680
I'll drink this one.

00:03:51.396 --> 00:03:52.912
Let me see

00:03:52.995 --> 00:03:57.075
Who has put in the most effort today.

00:04:01.105 --> 00:04:02.988
Forgive me, Your Highness. The road ahead is blocked.

00:04:03.012 --> 00:04:05.090
- We need to take a detour. - Which fool dares to block my way?

00:04:05.114 --> 00:04:06.280
Get lost.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.249
Where has the detour taken us?

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:12.408
(Princess Zhao Yang's Residence)

00:04:12.767 --> 00:04:15.409
How did we end up outside that wretch Zhao Yang's place?

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:19.952
Zhao Yang?

00:04:20.231 --> 00:04:22.464
Are you trying to copy me and do two at once?

00:04:22.682 --> 00:04:24.722
Aren't you worried that you'll throw your back out?

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.760
What's happening? Why does that person look just like Shen Xiao?

00:04:43.604 --> 00:04:45.320
It can't be Shen Xiao.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:48.062
Your Highness, you already have us.

00:04:48.477 --> 00:04:51.120
- Why bother thinking about some random guy outside? - Shut up.

00:04:51.472 --> 00:04:53.190
I'm busy thinking.

00:05:08.276 --> 00:05:09.960
Censor Shen, you've worked hard.

00:05:10.081 --> 00:05:12.082
I can take care of my sister myself.

00:05:17.563 --> 00:05:18.707
Actually, Your Highness and I...

00:05:18.731 --> 00:05:20.951
I had proof that the Crown Prince tried to kill his own sister,

00:05:20.975 --> 00:05:22.520
But Cui Jin Zhi destroyed it.

00:05:23.164 --> 00:05:24.740
Even though the evidence is gone,

00:05:24.915 --> 00:05:26.677
This can't just be ignored.

00:05:29.042 --> 00:05:30.600
I want to see His Majesty.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.093
If you accuse the Crown Prince with no proof,

00:05:33.375 --> 00:05:35.080
You'll end up taking the fall.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.302
We won't report the Crown Prince just yet.

00:05:37.642 --> 00:05:38.844
Are you trying to...

00:05:40.197 --> 00:05:41.399
I want...

00:05:43.833 --> 00:05:45.320
A divorce?

00:05:47.553 --> 00:05:49.429
Cui Jin Zhi has kept a mistress for years.

00:05:49.525 --> 00:05:52.088
He even let his mistress, Qing Luo, poison me.

00:05:53.083 --> 00:05:55.160
Besides feeling terrified and scared,

00:05:55.288 --> 00:05:58.000
I'm even furious because the Cui family ignored Father's dignity.

00:05:59.279 --> 00:06:01.880
I don't want to hide the divorce anymore.

00:06:02.193 --> 00:06:03.715
I hope you will grant my wish, Father.

00:06:06.411 --> 00:06:08.452
My oversight

00:06:08.652 --> 00:06:11.894
Has let you suffer all these years.

00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:16.063
However, are you really insisting on making the divorce public

00:06:16.172 --> 00:06:18.730
Because of his mistress

00:06:18.991 --> 00:06:20.193
Or

00:06:21.722 --> 00:06:24.924
Are you doing it because you and the Crown Prince have a rift?

00:06:26.123 --> 00:06:27.800
This marriage with the Cui family

00:06:27.898 --> 00:06:29.660
Is a dead end for you.

00:06:32.417 --> 00:06:33.920
Father, please judge wisely.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.582
What I ask for

00:06:35.695 --> 00:06:37.058
Is first, for my own sake.

00:06:37.516 --> 00:06:38.633
Secondly,

00:06:38.714 --> 00:06:41.916
I believe a royal marriage is also a matter of state.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:45.200
The Cui family needs to be put in their place now.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.356
Deliver my command.

00:06:52.559 --> 00:06:55.768
Summon Duke Ning to the palace at once.

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:57.682
Yes.

00:06:58.028 --> 00:06:59.230
I also hope

00:06:59.795 --> 00:07:02.156
That Father may let another person enter the palace.

00:07:03.856 --> 00:07:05.935
(Imperial Study)

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.133
I granted you the Princess's hand in marriage.

00:07:14.625 --> 00:07:17.186
Is this how much you love and protect her?

00:07:17.779 --> 00:07:18.977
I am fearful.

00:07:19.096 --> 00:07:21.257
My loyalty to the Princess is clear.

00:07:21.797 --> 00:07:23.007
I only ask Your Majesty

00:07:23.255 --> 00:07:25.175
Not to take the Princess's angry words to heart.

00:07:27.789 --> 00:07:29.148
Your Majesty, please judge wisely.

00:07:29.172 --> 00:07:31.800
Arguments are bound to happen for young couples.

00:07:31.969 --> 00:07:33.690
Heaven and earth can attest to

00:07:33.907 --> 00:07:35.827
How the Prince Consort has treated the Princess.

00:07:36.625 --> 00:07:39.021
Your Highness, even if you feel wronged,

00:07:39.214 --> 00:07:42.544
You shouldn't use divorce as a threat.

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:44.011
A threat?

00:07:45.154 --> 00:07:48.528
Prince Consort Cui handed me a divorce letter on our wedding night.

00:07:54.132 --> 00:07:57.477
Your Majesty never made this matter public back then.

00:07:58.292 --> 00:08:00.694
I deeply regret it all these years.

00:08:00.958 --> 00:08:03.920
But the sun and moon can bear witness to my feelings for the Princess.

00:08:04.236 --> 00:08:07.160
The so-called mistress is completely made up.

00:08:07.358 --> 00:08:09.120
Every mistake is mine.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.371
I shouldn't have argued with the Princess.

00:08:12.652 --> 00:08:14.722
Your Highness, please don't throw a tantrum anymore.

00:08:14.746 --> 00:08:16.188
You've disturbed His Majesty.

00:08:19.132 --> 00:08:20.334
In that case,

00:08:20.625 --> 00:08:23.139
Please summon the witness, Father.

00:08:26.308 --> 00:08:29.787
Summon Qing Luo to the hall!

00:08:59.504 --> 00:09:02.371
I, Qing Luo, a commoner, bow to Your Majesty.

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:05.821
Are you really the Prince Consort's mistress?

00:09:07.625 --> 00:09:09.360
I wouldn't dare deceive Your Majesty.

00:09:09.662 --> 00:09:12.665
The Prince Consort has kept me privately for years.

00:09:13.499 --> 00:09:16.459
I can explain this, Your Majesty.

00:09:19.357 --> 00:09:20.577
Go on.

00:09:23.883 --> 00:09:25.965
The Prince Consort looked down on my humble birth.

00:09:26.125 --> 00:09:27.927
After learning I was pregnant,

00:09:28.169 --> 00:09:31.080
He accused me of tainting the noble bloodline.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:33.252
He abandoned me

00:09:33.458 --> 00:09:35.459
And even wanted to kill me.

00:09:39.332 --> 00:09:40.973
If Her Highness hadn't saved me,

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:44.861
Both my unborn child and I would've died long ago.

00:09:47.821 --> 00:09:49.023
Enough!

00:09:49.539 --> 00:09:51.220
Who let this crazy woman in?

00:09:51.331 --> 00:09:54.293
How dare you stand before His Majesty and slander the Prince Consort

00:09:54.422 --> 00:09:56.422
Just to ruin the noble family's reputation?

00:09:59.441 --> 00:10:00.643
Your Majesty.

00:10:00.724 --> 00:10:02.887
This woman's background is unclear.

00:10:03.042 --> 00:10:04.442
She acts and speaks like a lunatic.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:05.736
She must not be trusted.

00:10:05.851 --> 00:10:07.976
She must be acting under someone's orders

00:10:08.073 --> 00:10:09.476
To frame the Prince Consort.

00:10:13.293 --> 00:10:15.132
Three inches below the Prince Consort's chest,

00:10:15.156 --> 00:10:17.480
There's a scar from martial arts training.

00:10:17.924 --> 00:10:19.720
I've served the Prince Consort for years.

00:10:19.953 --> 00:10:21.960
I know everything about him.

00:10:22.057 --> 00:10:23.460
I'm not making anything up.

00:10:24.989 --> 00:10:26.400
If Your Majesty doesn't believe me,

00:10:26.489 --> 00:10:28.132
I can explain everything in detail.

00:10:31.005 --> 00:10:32.885
- Your Majesty... - That's enough. Step back.

00:10:50.291 --> 00:10:51.640
Cui Jin Zhi.

00:10:52.052 --> 00:10:53.813
Do you have anything else to say?

00:11:01.236 --> 00:11:02.792
Your Majesty, calm down.

00:11:02.976 --> 00:11:04.120
I think

00:11:04.233 --> 00:11:06.471
Her Highness and Jin Zhi aren't truly husband and wife.

00:11:06.569 --> 00:11:08.930
It's reasonable for Jin Zhi to take a concubine.

00:11:09.083 --> 00:11:10.285
Besides,

00:11:10.407 --> 00:11:13.849
The Princess can't continue the Cui family bloodline.

00:11:14.134 --> 00:11:16.648
Jin Zhi sought to continue the family line,

00:11:16.842 --> 00:11:18.525
So he looked elsewhere.

00:11:18.878 --> 00:11:20.720
Though his methods weren't proper,

00:11:20.843 --> 00:11:23.769
His intentions may be understandable.

00:11:24.958 --> 00:11:27.400
This lowly maid has poor conduct.

00:11:27.591 --> 00:11:31.120
It's not unreasonable for the Prince Consort to deal with her himself.

00:11:31.323 --> 00:11:35.886
Family matters shouldn't be discussed here.

00:11:37.859 --> 00:11:39.622
What a convenient excuse.

00:11:41.196 --> 00:11:42.600
Are you saying

00:11:42.997 --> 00:11:44.479
That I, as the Princess,

00:11:44.613 --> 00:11:47.377
Can also keep male companions to bear children

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:49.238
And continue my lineage?

00:11:49.375 --> 00:11:50.532
Ridiculous!

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:53.470
A man taking concubines is a tradition passed down from our ancestors.

00:11:53.494 --> 00:11:55.010
How could Your Highness

00:11:55.171 --> 00:11:57.294
Ask such a rebellious and immoral question?

00:11:59.271 --> 00:12:01.032
The Prince Consort keeping a mistress

00:12:01.561 --> 00:12:03.198
Is seen as perfectly normal,

00:12:03.279 --> 00:12:05.160
But if the Princess keeps male companions,

00:12:05.583 --> 00:12:07.625
She deserves a thousand deaths?

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:09.952
You...

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.249
Father, I have something to report.

00:12:26.551 --> 00:12:29.633
I want to accuse Zhao Yang and Shen Xiao of having an affair.

00:12:35.451 --> 00:12:38.263
An Le, stop talking nonsense.

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.377
I saw it with my own eyes last night.

00:12:40.537 --> 00:12:42.869
Zhao Yang and Shen Xiao were hugging in the street.

00:12:43.071 --> 00:12:44.393
Their behavior was intimate.

00:12:44.649 --> 00:12:47.279
Father, you can find out whether I'm lying or not by investigating this.

00:12:47.303 --> 00:12:49.828
So, Your Highness insisted on getting a divorce

00:12:49.958 --> 00:12:51.959
Because you were already having an affair.

00:13:01.983 --> 00:13:03.410
Zhao Yang and Shen Xiao are innocent.

00:13:03.434 --> 00:13:06.354
- Shen Xiao and I are not innocent. - They couldn't have had an affair.

00:13:14.079 --> 00:13:15.521
You don't need to cover for me.

00:13:16.127 --> 00:13:17.399
Shen Xiao and I had an affair.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:18.682
That's the truth.

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:21.679
Your mistress used drugs to ruin my reputation,

00:13:22.059 --> 00:13:24.000
So Shen Xiao and I ended up alone together.

00:13:24.262 --> 00:13:25.942
Prince Consort Cui, you knew all about it.

00:13:28.914 --> 00:13:31.076
Zhao Yang had an affair with someone of humble birth.

00:13:31.238 --> 00:13:33.320
If this gets out,

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:35.840
Not only will it shame the Cui family,

00:13:36.265 --> 00:13:38.707
But also disgrace the royal family.

00:13:42.336 --> 00:13:43.872
(For generations, noble families)

00:13:43.978 --> 00:13:46.480
(care most about their reputation.)

00:13:46.611 --> 00:13:48.082
(Now that things have come to this, )

00:13:48.106 --> 00:13:51.080
(the Cui family won't insist on this marriage anymore.)

00:13:53.245 --> 00:13:54.447
Fine.

00:13:55.404 --> 00:13:57.081
Even if it was a setup,

00:13:57.252 --> 00:13:59.400
It's because you didn't behave yourself.

00:13:59.542 --> 00:14:01.018
That's why you gave others leverage.

00:14:01.146 --> 00:14:02.348
Your Majesty.

00:14:02.465 --> 00:14:04.182
The Cui family has always been upright.

00:14:04.304 --> 00:14:06.866
We won't allow a woman with such disgraceful conduct.

00:14:07.793 --> 00:14:09.721
- Zhao Yang just made a foolish mistake. - Enough!

00:14:09.745 --> 00:14:10.947
Your Majesty...

00:14:15.247 --> 00:14:16.449
Your Majesty.

00:14:17.188 --> 00:14:19.680
I request Your Majesty to issue your decree.

00:14:19.882 --> 00:14:22.924
Permit Princess Zhao Yang and Cui Jin Zhi

00:14:23.605 --> 00:14:25.167
To divorce immediately.

00:14:29.958 --> 00:14:31.440
In that case,

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:35.053
This marriage is called off.

00:14:43.458 --> 00:14:44.660
However,

00:14:45.333 --> 00:14:47.480
Though I allow you two to divorce,

00:14:47.634 --> 00:14:49.600
There must still be punishment as a warning.

00:14:49.839 --> 00:14:51.882
Zhao Yang's conduct is lacking.

00:14:51.995 --> 00:14:53.831
Reduce her fief by 3,000 households.

00:14:53.965 --> 00:14:56.000
Prince Consort Cui kept a mistress.

00:14:56.125 --> 00:14:58.000
He'll be fined half a year's salary.

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:00.692
This matter ends here.

00:15:15.125 --> 00:15:17.567
You're cutting ties with me for this humble-born man?

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:20.702
Li Shu!

00:15:22.411 --> 00:15:23.912
I can let go of what happened with Shen Xiao.

00:15:23.936 --> 00:15:26.058
I'll treat it as you just having a tantrum with me.

00:15:27.244 --> 00:15:29.280
Five days, ten days, or even a hundred days.

00:15:29.382 --> 00:15:30.902
I can wait for you.

00:15:31.213 --> 00:15:33.551
I'll wait until you've calmed down. All right?

00:15:33.664 --> 00:15:35.211
Cui Jin Zhi, wake up.

00:15:35.292 --> 00:15:36.812
The show is over.

00:15:39.375 --> 00:15:41.235
Lord Cui, please behave yourself.

00:15:42.806 --> 00:15:44.169
Since you've divorced,

00:15:44.352 --> 00:15:46.200
Please don't bother the Princess anymore.

00:15:48.369 --> 00:15:51.049
A humble-born man who climbed up the ranks with the help of a woman

00:15:51.243 --> 00:15:53.044
Has no right to lecture me.

00:15:56.818 --> 00:15:59.000
Li Shu, remember this.

00:16:00.395 --> 00:16:02.520
Only I can give you everything.

00:16:03.731 --> 00:16:06.600
And only I can destroy everything you have.

00:16:10.667 --> 00:16:13.068
You're really good at destroying people.

00:16:13.563 --> 00:16:15.244
But from now on,

00:16:15.566 --> 00:16:17.408
I won't play along anymore.

00:16:25.284 --> 00:16:26.486
One day,

00:16:27.043 --> 00:16:29.566
You'll come to me with nothing, begging for help.

00:16:41.098 --> 00:16:43.060
When I earn military honors next year,

00:16:44.398 --> 00:16:47.121
I'll ask His Majesty to grant us marriage.

00:16:47.917 --> 00:16:49.119
When that time comes,

00:16:49.252 --> 00:16:50.649
No one will be able to bully you.

00:16:50.789 --> 00:16:52.800
Not even the Crown Prince.

00:17:03.898 --> 00:17:05.259
The battlefield is dangerous.

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:06.741
You really need to be careful.

00:17:07.972 --> 00:17:10.692
I'll definitely come back safe for you.

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.477
What bad luck.

00:17:38.614 --> 00:17:41.040
She lost her fief and became Cui family's discarded wife,

00:17:41.676 --> 00:17:43.037
Yet she's still so smug.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:50.487
(Princess An Le.)

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.041
(Thanks for your help.)

00:17:57.138 --> 00:18:00.920
(I purposely set up a roadblock on Princess An Le's usual route.)

00:18:01.097 --> 00:18:02.498
Where has the detour taken us?

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:05.142
(I led her past the Princess Residence, )

00:18:06.042 --> 00:18:07.560
(so she'd find out)

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:09.590
(that I was involved with Princess Zhao Yang.)

00:18:12.792 --> 00:18:14.034
Zhao Yang?

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:16.620
(If Her Highness wanted to break free from the Cui family, )

00:18:16.723 --> 00:18:18.363
(she still needed Princess An Le's help.)

00:18:18.542 --> 00:18:20.520
Why does that person look just like Shen Xiao?

00:19:04.125 --> 00:19:05.163
You lost your reputation

00:19:05.251 --> 00:19:06.680
And got scolded by His Majesty.

00:19:06.874 --> 00:19:08.556
How can you still laugh?

00:19:08.847 --> 00:19:10.930
We cut ties with the Eastern Palace. Of course, we're happy.

00:19:10.954 --> 00:19:12.156
That's right.

00:19:12.771 --> 00:19:16.400
But you said you're my sister's male companion.

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:18.480
That's deceiving His Majesty.

00:19:22.113 --> 00:19:23.476
We didn't deceive His Majesty.

00:19:24.333 --> 00:19:26.134
I really am the Princess's male companion.

00:19:31.315 --> 00:19:32.353
Le Sheng,

00:19:32.484 --> 00:19:34.045
About this, I...

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:41.452
Censor Shen,

00:19:42.333 --> 00:19:43.614
Let's have a chat outside.

00:20:01.625 --> 00:20:02.868
Let's spar a bit.

00:20:04.859 --> 00:20:06.061
I'm still not healed.

00:20:10.875 --> 00:20:12.083
You're serious?

00:20:13.819 --> 00:20:15.056
I see you as a friend,

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:16.882
But you wronged my sister.

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:20.093
I wronged your sister?

00:20:24.759 --> 00:20:26.241
How far did it go?

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.320
It started with feelings.

00:20:33.564 --> 00:20:35.641
Most of the time, it stayed proper.

00:20:35.779 --> 00:20:37.501
Most of the time?

00:20:43.379 --> 00:20:44.740
Stay away from her.

00:20:46.458 --> 00:20:48.259
I'm sincere about her.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:51.702
Really?

00:20:52.578 --> 00:20:53.780
Really.

00:20:54.611 --> 00:20:56.134
But your sister

00:20:57.164 --> 00:20:58.281
Has always treated me

00:20:58.375 --> 00:21:00.800
Like a male companion she could summon or dismiss at will.

00:21:01.867 --> 00:21:04.880
She was the one who gave me the gold and jewelry last time.

00:21:11.874 --> 00:21:13.076
That's good.

00:21:14.193 --> 00:21:16.960
You're lucky to catch my sister's eye.

00:21:18.847 --> 00:21:21.920
Your Highness, do you mean I'm just supposed to be played with?

00:21:23.087 --> 00:21:25.520
Since going from the Cold Palace to where she's at today,

00:21:25.744 --> 00:21:28.520
Money is what my sister values most, besides her life.

00:21:28.757 --> 00:21:31.477
She has never spent so much on personal matters.

00:21:32.459 --> 00:21:34.818
These are your reward.

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:38.580
She goes to Xianke Bordello because she manages it for the Crown Prince.

00:21:38.853 --> 00:21:40.693
Do you really think she's reckless with money?

00:21:46.456 --> 00:21:48.057
Are you saying

00:21:49.231 --> 00:21:50.832
That she actually likes me too?

00:21:57.571 --> 00:22:00.600
From now on, you'll be my brother-in-law.

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:01.932
How do you feel about that?

00:22:04.524 --> 00:22:06.960
If I see you coming out of my sister's room again,

00:22:07.083 --> 00:22:08.365
I'll break your legs.

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:24.247
He knows everything now?

00:22:24.855 --> 00:22:26.097
So, who won?

00:22:27.417 --> 00:22:28.958
Of course, I let him win.

00:22:29.500 --> 00:22:30.750
I still need him

00:22:30.869 --> 00:22:33.160
To put in a good word for me with Your Highness.

00:22:34.332 --> 00:22:35.760
What good word?

00:22:38.642 --> 00:22:40.124
I need him to help me

00:22:40.868 --> 00:22:42.287
Get a proper status.

00:22:44.583 --> 00:22:46.520
What's so important about status?

00:22:46.895 --> 00:22:48.937
I just escaped from all that empty fame.

00:22:49.675 --> 00:22:53.109
In this world, only real gold and silver matter.

00:22:53.417 --> 00:22:56.814
Why don't I give you a mansion with eight courtyards tomorrow

00:22:56.934 --> 00:22:58.611
With 200 servants?

00:22:58.821 --> 00:23:00.783
How's that? Sound good?

00:23:02.661 --> 00:23:05.061
(Since going from the Cold Palace to where she's at today, )

00:23:05.116 --> 00:23:07.876
(money is what my sister values most, besides her life.)

00:23:12.307 --> 00:23:15.480
Then, I thank Your Highness for this generous gift.

00:23:35.323 --> 00:23:37.160
When I picked a Top Scholar

00:23:37.396 --> 00:23:39.317
From a humble family,

00:23:40.049 --> 00:23:41.850
I asked your opinion.

00:23:42.547 --> 00:23:43.880
Back then,

00:23:44.000 --> 00:23:45.717
You recommended Shen Xiao first.

00:23:45.875 --> 00:23:49.077
So, you two already knew each other.

00:23:50.835 --> 00:23:52.037
Zhao Yang,

00:23:52.667 --> 00:23:56.309
Were you acting out of personal interest?

00:23:58.764 --> 00:24:00.040
I didn't.

00:24:00.458 --> 00:24:02.180
I wouldn't dare deceive you, Father.

00:24:02.569 --> 00:24:05.967
Shen Xiao is just one of my many retainers.

00:24:06.154 --> 00:24:07.876
I've never paid him special attention.

00:24:08.523 --> 00:24:10.440
When I first saw Shen Xiao's essay,

00:24:10.531 --> 00:24:13.132
It criticized current issues and showed real insight.

00:24:13.401 --> 00:24:15.450
I value talent for the Ye Dynasty and you, Father.

00:24:15.548 --> 00:24:16.761
That was why I recommended him.

00:24:16.785 --> 00:24:18.106
There was no personal motive.

00:24:18.279 --> 00:24:20.640
I wouldn't dare use Shen Xiao to meddle in politics.

00:24:21.792 --> 00:24:23.234
I hope you see my sincerity, Father.

00:24:24.292 --> 00:24:25.640
The floor is cold.

00:24:25.805 --> 00:24:27.007
Get up.

00:24:30.468 --> 00:24:31.670
Thank you, Father.

00:24:39.220 --> 00:24:42.341
As long as you and Shen Xiao have no ulterior motives.

00:24:49.332 --> 00:24:50.800
I've heard

00:24:52.232 --> 00:24:56.274
Jin Cheng from Prince Qi's family is still unmarried.

00:24:57.875 --> 00:24:59.397
As her cousin,

00:24:59.972 --> 00:25:01.932
You should keep an eye out for potential suitors.

00:25:03.289 --> 00:25:06.930
Jin Cheng is indeed old enough to be looking for a husband.

00:25:07.333 --> 00:25:08.656
I'm not very clever.

00:25:08.927 --> 00:25:12.087
I wonder if you have someone in your mind for her marriage, Father.

00:25:13.750 --> 00:25:14.952
I think

00:25:16.917 --> 00:25:18.718
Shen Xiao would be a good choice.

